= Accessing PKI Services =

To access PKI services via Web UI open [https://server.example.com:8443/ https://server.example.com:8443/] with a browser.

To access PKI services via command-line, use the [https://www.dogtagpki.org/wiki/PKI_CLI PKI CLI].

By default only the [https://www.dogtagpki.org/wiki/Default_CA_Admin Default CA Admin] and end-entities can access PKI services. Follow [https://www.dogtagpki.org/wiki/User_Certificate_Setup User Certificate Setup] to add additional system users.

= Managing PKI Services =

To manage PKI services via PKI Console:
<pre>
$ pkiconsole https://server.example.com:8443/<subsystem>
</pre>

To manage PKI services via CLI, use the [[PKI Server CLI]].

